{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an old fishing trawler and head into the fog-covered waters in search of a catch.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch fish</strong>, sell your haul, and gradually upgrade your gear.<br>Start with a simple rod - over time, you'll unlock nets, a winch, and even dynamite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep your vessel running:</strong> refuel, fix breakdowns, and manually manage speed and direction using separate levers and the helm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might need to <strong>defend yourself</strong> \u2014 the waters aren't always calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> with a mysterious dockside merchant and keep an eye on the day-night cycle. Strange things tend to happen after dark.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676140?t=1767814398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676140?t=1767814398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676140/66dd1e7a169bfe83841f0db0275dfbd0af7f2903/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767814398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676140/66dd1e7a169bfe83841f0db0275dfbd0af7f2903/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767814398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gloomy and frightening atmosphere and imagery, sudden frightening scenes. Unpleasant display of sea creatures, dismembered carcasses of sea creatures."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an old fishing trawler and head into the fog-covered waters in search of a catch.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch fish</strong>, sell your haul, 